# How the light of -gi 1 dies out in the chains of probes (step 2b of the ray-tracing revisit,
# reports/render-features/2026-11-08-rt-revisit/step-2b.md): noon goes to 22:00 at once, the camera holds still.
# The plank hut and the bandit cave of gi-clips (views hut-night-1 and cave-night-1): 1 s of noon, then 14 s of night.
# A jump of the time of day relights the probes from nothing (Renderer::prepareGi); OPENGOTHIC_GI_JUMP_RESET=0 turns
# that off, and the clip shows how long the day's light lives on in probes that light each other, as after a fire
# put out. `uv run scripts/gi_compare.py --decay <out>/hut-decay.mp4` prints how many times brighter than its night
# each cell is at 0.5, 1 and 2 s, and when every cell is within 10% of it.
#   OPENGOTHIC_GI_JUMP_RESET=0 OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_GI=1 TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen \
#     scripts/bench.sh gi-decay
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off

set time 12 0
goto NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_HUT_01_IN
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 110
cam world 180 170 0
wait 10000
cam hold
rec hut-decay
wait 1000
set time 22 0
wait 14000
stop

set time 12 0
goto NW_FARM1_BANDITS_CAVE_02
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 120
cam world 350 180 0
wait 10000
cam hold
rec cave-decay
wait 1000
set time 22 0
wait 14000
stop
